WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:00.902
(audience cheering)
- [Kelly] So,

00:00:00.902 --> 00:00:02.810
- You've been doing lot of
impressions on the show.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:03.891
You're so great at impressions.

00:00:03.891 --> 00:00:05.357
- [Seth] Thank you. I'm
so not, but thank you.

00:00:05.357 --> 00:00:06.480
- You are!

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.313
- No, no, no.

00:00:07.313 --> 00:00:08.146
- Stop it!
- I have been doing

00:00:08.146 --> 00:00:08.979
- Do you need a fan to?

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:09.812
(audience laughs)

00:00:09.812 --> 00:00:11.550
Stop it, with the fan.

00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:12.677
The window is hot!

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.240
No, but is it something
you've always been good at?

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:16.073
Or did you like practice?

00:00:16.073 --> 00:00:18.510
- I do want to point out
that this like window

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:20.040
is like a magnifying glass

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:21.100
and we're the ants,

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:22.175
- That's what I said!

00:00:22.175 --> 00:00:23.780
- It coming through

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:25.340
- That's literally what
I said in rehearsals.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.173
When you were a kid

00:00:26.173 --> 00:00:27.420
and you had a magnifying
glass on the playground

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:28.960
and you'd get the ant, and
that's really messed up,

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:31.100
but you know, you'd just
be like, wow, that happens.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:31.933
Yeah, or what?

00:00:31.933 --> 00:00:34.848
- I watched other kids do it.
- Yeah, me too.

00:00:34.848 --> 00:00:35.681
- You did it?

00:00:35.681 --> 00:00:37.000
- No, I mean, I, you know,

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.190
I don't even remember if I did it,

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:39.450
but I know we all were out there.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.090
- That's why the rats are staring at you.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.983
They're like, we heard.

00:00:42.983 --> 00:00:45.916
Our ants friend told us, we know.

00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:47.980
- We know who you are
- Oh Kelly's "so nice"

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.653
(laughter)
- Ant Killer.

00:00:49.653 --> 00:00:52.100
It's like, no, it is really hot,

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.177
but wait, do you, did you
grow up doing impressions?

00:00:55.177 --> 00:00:56.940
- No, I didn't do impressions at all

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:58.930
and I was terrible at
doing impressions on SNL

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:00.740
and then I just, you know,
- [Kelly] No you weren't!

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:01.945
- No, I was
- You're a liar!

00:01:01.945 --> 00:01:04.460
- But no, I don't we like to pretend,

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.850
we like to talk about how bad I am

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:06.910
at the impressions on the show

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:07.970
- [Kelly] Oh
- And that's

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:09.220
but you know, but that's probably,

00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:11.190
that's that thing of
like "Aren't I terrible?"

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.554
and just like desperate for praise.

00:01:12.554 --> 00:01:13.500
(laughter)
Yeah.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.640
- Clap for me.
- [Seth] Yeah, yeah

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.930
- Who have you, have you
done impressions of people?

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.010
- [Seth] All right here's the thing,

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:19.150
it's very polarizing at the show.

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:20.180
A lot of people in the staff

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.530
think I do a terrible Vince Vaughn.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:22.580
I'm going to do my Vince
Vaughn for you ready.

00:01:22.580 --> 00:01:23.700
- Okay
(audience cheers)

00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:24.640
I love Vince Vaughn!

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:27.940
- Don't build it up.
- [Kelly] (laughs) just to be

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:28.830
All right, ready?
- [Kelly] Yes.

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:30.090
It's a three-word impression
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.630
- And it's the same word three times.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:32.463
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:01:32.463 --> 00:01:33.296
Ready.

00:01:33.296 --> 00:01:34.762
Buddy, buddy, buddy.

00:01:34.762 --> 00:01:38.512
(audience cheers and laughs)

00:01:42.930 --> 00:01:45.810
- [Kelly] So you know how much I love you.

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:47.246
- Yeah.
- That was not good.

00:01:47.246 --> 00:01:48.730
(laughter)

00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:50.300
- See?
- Buddy, buddy, buddy?

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.250
- No, that's like,

00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:53.540
because Vince Vaughn is often
trying to convince someone

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:54.373
who was a friend of his,
- Yeah.

00:01:54.373 --> 00:01:55.930
- To do a bad idea.

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:56.920
And he often like prefaces it,

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.091
be like, buddy, buddy, buddy.

00:01:59.091 --> 00:01:59.924
(laughter)

00:01:59.924 --> 00:02:00.757
- [Kelly] It was a
little better that time.

00:02:00.757 --> 00:02:03.050
- It's already getting worse.
(laughter)

00:02:03.050 --> 00:02:05.330
- So is it true that before you got SNL

00:02:05.330 --> 00:02:06.163
that you were actually

00:02:06.163 --> 00:02:08.147
trying to make a living doing
commercials? Is that true?

00:02:08.147 --> 00:02:09.103
- No, I wasn't trying to like make it,

00:02:09.103 --> 00:02:11.090
like I would go to auditions

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:12.100
- [Kelly] Yeah
- For commercials.

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:13.190
- [Kelly] Yeah, but
that's making a living.

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.023
It's paying the bills.

00:02:14.023 --> 00:02:16.153
- [Seth] Eh, when you saw what
they paid you, not really.

00:02:16.153 --> 00:02:17.610
(laughter)

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.130
I did a commercial

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:22.410
for a furniture store
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:23.542
- Where I,

00:02:23.542 --> 00:02:24.920
this is my line.

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:26.220
I remember, I don't remember the name.

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.640
Let's say it was Chicago Couches.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:28.473
- Okay.

00:02:28.473 --> 00:02:29.306
- [Seth] It was something
along the lines of

00:02:29.306 --> 00:02:32.000
"At Chicago Couches they
put the customer first.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.185
That's me, I'm the customer."

00:02:34.185 --> 00:02:35.020
(laughter)

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:35.853
Pretty good.

00:02:35.853 --> 00:02:37.840
And I will tell you, I
did not get paid enough

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:39.050
to buy a couch.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.340
- I did not, oh my God.

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:41.610
- [Seth] Yeah, it wasn't a lot.

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.640
- People always think that
once you're on TV you make

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.473
- [Seth] They think!
- [Kelly] They think that

00:02:44.473 --> 00:02:45.306
That's the thing, they see on TV once

00:02:45.306 --> 00:02:46.139
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:46.139 --> 00:02:46.972
- They think you've got
money for everybody.

00:02:46.972 --> 00:02:47.805
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:47.805 --> 00:02:48.638
- And you're like, I don't
even have couch money.

00:02:48.638 --> 00:02:49.471
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:49.471 --> 00:02:50.350
I remember even after
idol, people thought,

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:51.610
oh gosh, she's like loaded.

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:52.443
No, you're not,
- [Seth] Oh yeah.

00:02:52.443 --> 00:02:53.276
- They lie.

00:02:53.276 --> 00:02:54.109
They say, oh it's a million dollars.

00:02:54.109 --> 00:02:55.904
And it's like "contract" you never see it.

00:02:55.904 --> 00:02:56.737
(laughter)

00:02:56.737 --> 00:02:57.570
You never, it's like nope.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.403
- [Seth] They show you a million dollars

00:02:58.403 --> 00:02:59.236
- Yeah, yeah.

00:02:59.236 --> 00:03:00.910
But you came close to getting a commercial

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.230
playing Mr. Summer Man?

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:03.220
- [Seth] Mr. Summer Man.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:04.053
- I need to know Mr. Summer Man

00:03:04.053 --> 00:03:05.428
- I came very close to Mr. Summer Man.

00:03:05.428 --> 00:03:06.261
- [Kelly] Who is Mr. Summer Man?

00:03:06.261 --> 00:03:07.878
And this was, it was for Sonic.

00:03:07.878 --> 00:03:08.711
It was for

00:03:08.711 --> 00:03:10.410
- [Kelly] Oh, like the place to eat?

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.243
- [Seth] Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:03:11.243 --> 00:03:12.700
- And I was really close.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:14.700
And this would have changed everything.

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:16.980
- [Kelly] Would you, did you
have to wear rollerskates?

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:17.813
- [Seth] No.
- Oh

00:03:17.813 --> 00:03:18.646
- I don't know what I had to do.

00:03:18.646 --> 00:03:19.600
- Because they do that.
- Yeah.

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:21.700
But you know, it was
then, one of my closest,

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.530
you remember those two Sonic
guys in the drive through?

00:03:23.530 --> 00:03:24.363
- Yes!

00:03:24.363 --> 00:03:25.800
- One of them is my oldest friend.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:26.633
- [Kelly] Really?

00:03:26.633 --> 00:03:27.466
- Pete Grosz.
- [Kelly] I love those!

00:03:27.466 --> 00:03:28.299
- The guy who's usually driving.

00:03:28.299 --> 00:03:29.132
- Yeah, yeah.

00:03:29.132 --> 00:03:30.040
- And so that was the real burn.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.670
- Okay cause your friend got it.

00:03:31.670 --> 00:03:33.040
- [Seth] I was supposed
to be Mr. Summer Guy

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:35.610
Next thing I know he's the
Sonic guy for 20 years.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:36.590
- [Kelly] Oh my gosh.

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:37.423
Sonic is good.

00:03:37.423 --> 00:03:38.256
- [Seth] I was really very,

00:03:38.256 --> 00:03:39.180
it's actually deeply rude

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.376
that you brought up Mr. Summer Man

00:03:40.376 --> 00:03:41.410
(laughter)

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:43.010
- I really wanted to
know what it entailed,

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.120
then if you had to wear roller skates.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.230
I just pictured you roller
skating around a Sonic.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:49.070
- [Seth] Yeah, I just remember that,

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:49.903
I didn't get it.

00:03:49.903 --> 00:03:51.992
(laughter)

00:03:51.992 --> 00:03:55.503
- Aww (laughs)

